  "bio": {
    "text": "Dan Miragliotta is a professional mixed martial arts referee and judge from the United States, best known for officiating numerous bouts promoted by the Ultimate Fighting Championship (UFC), dating back to UFC 78. He was credited as one the best referees in MMA, as well as one of the most recognizable and active referees on the promotion in both 2022 and 2023. As of August 2026, Miragliotta has officiated 1,668 MMA fights.",
